WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.090
Some growers pump extra carbon
dioxide into their glasshouses.

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.430
Not by accident.

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.790
On purpose.

4
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.590
They pay for the gas, pipe
it in among their crops,

5
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.610
and their crops grow bigger.

6
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.370
Why would adding more carbon
dioxide give a bigger crop?

7
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.390
In this mission, you'll see
how glasshouses change the

8
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.140
conditions that crops grow in.

9
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.110
You'll find out why
farmers add fertilisers,

10
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.450
and which mineral ions
those fertilisers replace.

11
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.190
And you'll compare two ways
of keeping pests down:

12
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.090
chemical and biological.

13
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:35.910
Your mission: explain why extra
carbon dioxide gives a bigger

14
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.900
crop.
